# This directory is no longer a build input.
#
# The openFHIR HAPI interceptor JAR is fetched at build time from the pinned
# GitHub release asset — see docker/hapi/Dockerfile (ARG INTERCEPTOR_VERSION).
# There is nothing to drop here by hand; the Dockerfile populates the classpath
# via COPY --from=fetch. This .gitkeep only preserves the empty directory.
